error[E0475]: a spawned call can't capture `hits`: it is a `Ref<i64>`, which two tasks would share
   --> tests/programs/concurrency/sendable/e0475_spawn.la:10:17
   |
10 |         s.spawn(fun() { hits.set(1); }());
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: keep shared state in an actor, or send copies through a channel: a `Ref` belongs to one task

error[E0475]: a `Shared` can't be passed to another task: `hits` is a `Ref<i64>`, which two tasks would share
   --> tests/programs/concurrency/sendable/e0475_spawn.la:11:22
   |
11 |         s.spawn(work(Shared { hits: hits }));
   |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: keep shared state in an actor, or send copies through a channel: a `Ref` belongs to one task

error[E0475]: a `Ref<i64>` can't come back from another task as its result: it is a `Ref<i64>`, which two tasks would share
